{"id":605,"slug":"table-024","category_slug":"table","name":"可排序数据表","description":"点表头升降序","tags":["Table","交互","排序","Tailwind","Linear","Vercel","扁平"],"preview_html":"\n<div style=\"padding:16px\">\n  <table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px\">\n    <thead><tr style=\"text-align:left;color:#666;background:#fafafa\">\n      <th onclick=\"var th=this;var idx=th.cellIndex;var tb=th.closest('table').querySelector('tbody');var rows=Array.from(tb.rows);var asc=th.dataset.asc!=='1';th.dataset.asc=asc?'1':'0';rows.sort(function(a,b){var x=a.cells[idx].textContent,y=b.cells[idx].textContent;return asc?x.localeCompare(y,'zh'):y.localeCompare(x,'zh')});rows.forEach(function(r){tb.appendChild(r)})\" style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e8e8;cursor:pointer\">名称 ↕</th>\n      <th onclick=\"var th=this;var idx=th.cellIndex;var tb=th.closest('table').querySelector('tbody');var rows=Array.from(tb.rows);var asc=th.dataset.asc!=='1';th.dataset.asc=asc?'1':'0';rows.sort(function(a,b){var x=Number(a.cells[idx].textContent),y=Number(b.cells[idx].textContent);return asc?x-y:y-x});rows.forEach(function(r){tb.appendChild(r)})\" style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e8e8;cursor:pointer\">数量 ↕</th>\n    </tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0\">组件 A</td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0\">12</td></tr>\n      <tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0\">组件 B</td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0\">5</td></tr>\n      <tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0\">组件 C</td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0\">28</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>","prompt":"设计可排序数据表：点击表头按该列升/降序重排行，名称按中文、数量按数值排序。","prompt_short":"可排序数据表：点表头升降序 风格 Table / 交互 / 排序 / Tailwind","sort":10,"category_name":"表格","category_group":"数据展示","prompt_refactor":"把现有页面里的「可排序数据表」改成